"""The instruction-following checks measure what the prompt says.

Covers `MQC_CAS_UNI_115749`, inventoried in
``docs/testing/model_evaluation_test_plan.md`` section 8.1.

A failure here is **not a model finding**, so the module carries no priority
marker, per the harness ``framework-rules.md`` section 3.3.
"""

# ------------------------------------------------------------- cases in here
